    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. I'm a bit worried about the \"wear and tear\" aspect though. Even with high-end materials, things tend to get scuffed or damaged in those lobby environments. What's the realistic lifespan of each if we're talking about hundreds of people walking through every day? And are there specific types of surface damage I should be most concerned about long-term?",
