      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding those surface issues—especially with the scuffs and the weird wear patterns from heavy use—do certain materials tend to show those marks more \"mischievously\" or unpredictably? Like, are there some materials where you just notice damage appearing out of nowhere or in spots that don't seem to follow the actual foot traffic paths?",
